WEBVTT

00:05:26.781 --> 00:05:30.159
until logging, mining and other extractive

00:05:30.201 --> 00:05:33.204
and destructive development

00:05:33.245 --> 00:05:36.499
ripped resources from the earth.

00:05:37.249 --> 00:05:38.876
And here we are,

00:05:38.918 --> 00:05:42.129
looking at experts who advised on that

00:05:42.129 --> 00:05:46.509
to advise to us about the solutions
for climate change.

00:05:48.469 --> 00:05:52.556
Maybe we need to rethink
about the definition of experts.

00:05:52.556 --> 00:05:56.268
Maybe the experts
are the Indigenous people

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:00.898
who've lived lifetimes and centuries
and have protected the earth